#
# Form 500 UET (Rev. 07/15/25), Georgia's underpayment of estimated tax form
# and its instructions, printed "For tax years 2025 and later". One anchor
# per line the estimated tax rules fill, and one per instruction they follow.
# Page numbers count the PDF's pages from 1.

